  "story": {
    "day": 51,
    "title": "Kaya's Mexico Project",
    "sentences": [
      "This morning, Kaya woke up early.",
      "In the afternoon, she went to school for her project on Mexico.",
      "She showed some photos of their culture.",
      "One photo was of a Mexican baseball player.",
      "He wore a colorful uniform design.",
      "Kaya needed to talk about him today.",
      "Her teammate, Ken, helped her with these.",
      "\"We're ready to welcome them!\" Ken said.",
      "They played a Spanish singer's music.",
      "Kaya showed a small ball and her pen.",
      "\"Do we have any more?\" she asked.",
      "They went home in the evening."
    ]
  }
}